== Trivia ==
* Upon obtaining the Whore of Babylon effect, a popup displaying the text ''"What a horrible night to have a curse"'' appears on-screen. This can be disabled in the game options.
** This text is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Castlevania II: Simon's Quest|Castlevania II: Simon's Quest]]''. In the game, the text appears when the sun goes down.
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', Whore of Babylon gave a higher stat increase just for the room it was activated in, with +2.16 damage and +0.36 speed.
** {{p|III - The Empress}} was also much stronger, with +3.375 damage and +0.45 speed.
* The Whore of Babylon is an evil creature mentioned in the [[wikipedia:The Book of Revelation|Book of Revelations]].
* This item is used in {{chal|Darkness Falls}}.

